#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gnome-online-accounts.xml:30
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>GNOME Online Accounts</application> package contains a "
"framework used to access the user's online accounts."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>GNOME Online Accounts</application> contém uma "
"estrutura usada para acessar as contas online de usuário(a)."

